    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the message that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " revealed to the prophet Habakkuk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", how long must I call for help before you listen, before you save us from violence? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why do you make me see such trouble? How can you endure to look on such wrongdoing? Destruction and violence are all round me, and there is fighting and quarrelling everywhere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The law is weak and useless, and justice is never done. Evil people get the better of the righteous, and so justice is perverted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 13.41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to his people, “Keep watching the nations round you, and you will be astonished at what you see. I am going to do something that you will not believe when you hear about it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kgs 24.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am bringing the Babylonians to power, those fierce, restless people. They are marching out across the world to conquer other lands. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They spread fear and terror, and in their pride they are a law to themselves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Their horses are faster than leopards, fiercer than hungry wolves. Their horsemen come riding from distant lands; their horses paw the ground. They come swooping down like eagles attacking their prey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Their armies advance in violent conquest, and everyone is terrified as they approach.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "and everyone",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "approach",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Their captives are as numerous as grains of sand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They treat kings with contempt and laugh at high officials. No fortress can stop them — they pile up earth against it and capture it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they sweep on like the wind and are gone, these men whose power is their god.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", from the very beginning you are God. You are my God, holy and eternal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", my God and protector, you have chosen the Babylonians and made them strong so that they can punish us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But how can you stand these treacherous, evil men? Your eyes are too holy to look at evil, and you cannot stand the sight of people doing wrong. So why are you silent while they destroy people who are more righteous than they are?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How can you treat people like fish or like a swarm of insects that have no ruler to direct them? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Babylonians catch people with hooks, as though they were fish. They drag them off in nets and shout for joy over their catch! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They even worship their nets and offer sacrifices to them, because their nets provide them with the best of everything.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAB 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Are they going to use their swords for ever and keep on destroying nations without mercy?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAB.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAB.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
